## 3. Kleinster Codeweg

Neue Funktion in client/src/lib/portfolio/positions.ts (Signatur von computePortfolioPerformanceSeries bleibt):

```ts
export function rebasePerformanceSeries(
  series: PortfolioPerformancePoint[],
  fromDate: string,
): PortfolioPerformancePoint[] {
  const sliced = series.filter(pt => pt.date >= fromDate);
  if (sliced.length === 0) return [];
  const base = 1 + sliced[0].performancePct;
  if (!Number.isFinite(base) || base === 0) return [];
  return sliced.map(pt => ({
    date: pt.date,
    performancePct: (1 + pt.performancePct) / base - 1,
  }));
}
```

In PortfolioOverview.tsx:

```ts
const rawSeries = computePortfolioPerformanceSeries(...)
const series = rebasePerformanceSeries(rawSeries, cutoffDate(timeframe))
```

Nicht nur filterByTimeframe(rawSeries).

Select: option value=2Y → 2 Jahre. Default-Prop timeframe="1Y".
Guard: |R_end| > 200% auf Fenster <= 2Y → Flag unplausibles V0.

Attribution-Equity-Curve (PortfolioBacktestPanel) dieselbe Rebase-Regel + Presets 1Y/2Y. Abweichung Overview vs. Attribution > 0,1 pp bei gleichem Fenster und Marktwert-Gewichten = Bug.

